*#toolname* is an interactive *dementia classification assistant*, which helps clinicians screen for dementia from EEG recordings. It is built around *xEEGNet* @2025-Zanola-xEEGNet, a small, fully *interpretable* machine learning model with only $F dot.c (C+L+2) = 168$ trainable parameters, for the classification of two dementia subtypes from raw EEG traces @2023-miltiadous-dataset.

